# Ticket 3: Account Disabled – User Unable to Log In

## Issue
User `jane.smith` was unable to log in despite using the correct password.

---

## Investigation
- Verified password was correct
- Checked account status using: net user jane.smith

- Found account was disabled

---

## Resolution
1. Enabled the account using: net user jane.smith /active:yes
---

## Result
User successfully logged in after account was re-enabled.

